{"id":"662120","name":"肉饼荷叶饭","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/662120/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"大米","amount":"100g"},{"name":"猪肉","amount":"80g"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"1个"}],"sub":[{"name":"荷叶","amount":"一张"},{"name":"葱花","amount":"适量"},{"name":"蒜","amount":"1瓣"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备食材，大米、猪肉、鸡蛋、小葱。","img":"images/662120/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"盆里放入烫软的荷叶。","img":"images/662120/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"放入淘洗好的大米。","img":"images/662120/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加入适量的清水浸泡15分钟。","img":"images/662120/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"入蒸锅。","img":"images/662120/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"盖上盖蒸30分钟。","img":"images/662120/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"接下来的时间，剁肉末。","img":"images/662120/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放入蒜末、盐、胡椒粉、酱油、淀粉调味。","img":"images/662120/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"搅拌均匀后放点花生油。","img":"images/662120/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"米饭蒸了15分钟后开盖。","img":"images/662120/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"摊入肉末，中间挖个口。","img":"images/662120/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"打入鸡蛋，盖上盖继续蒸至时间结束。","img":"images/662120/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"时间到。","img":"images/662120/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"撒入小葱花，淋入酱油和小磨香油，焖上1分钟出锅。","img":"images/662120/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/662120/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}